  "statement": "Evaluate \\[ \\begin{aligned} &\\log_{10}(\\tan1^\\circ)\\\\ &\\quad+\\log_{10}(\\tan2^\\circ)\\\\ &\\quad+\\log_{10}(\\tan3^\\circ)+\\cdots\\\\ &\\quad+\\log_{10}(\\tan88^\\circ)\\\\ &\\quad+\\log_{10}(\\tan89^\\circ). \\end{aligned} \\]",
